/**
 * Script to build a biomass stock model for CCAL (Cadastro de Carbono e Água de Longo prazo).
 * 
 * Data Inputs:
 *   - QCN (Natural Carbon Quantification)
 *   - MapBiomas (Land Use/Land Cover + Deforestation and Secondary Vegetation)
 * 
 * Outputs:
 *   - Biomass stock (tC/ha) images over time
 * 
 * Processing Steps:
 *   1. Calculate Gain and Loss Budget
 *   2. Compute Total Biomass
 *   3. Incorporate Degradation (Fire and Selective Logging)
 * 
 * Assets Used:
 *   - Increment Table (Regeneration increments by land cover transitions)
 *   - Biomass Data (past_carbon)
 *   - Deforestation and Secondary Vegetation Data (desf_reg_raw)
 *   - Land Use/Land Cover Data (lulc_original)
 *   - Biomes Shapefile (biomas)
 * 
 * Visualization:
 *   - A single dictionary for visualization parameters
